      "description": "As a shopper, I want to review the items selected, the quantity of each item, and the price (along with any discounts/coupons), so that I can make the correct payment.\n\nAC: The customer should be able to see the items selected with the correct quantities and a subtotal amount. There should be a \"checkout\" button that will move your over to the purchase page that allows you to pay.",
