      "name": "Shopping Cart",
      "description": "BENEFIT: Shoppers can manage items in a shopping cart for immediate or future purchase\nAC: Shoppers can easily access their cart from any page, change the quantity, add &remove it from their cart. A subtotal for all items in their shopping cart should be displayed at the bottom. Checkout button is at the bottom of the shopping cart.",
