      "description": "As a Customer\nI want to easily access my cart from any page\nSo that I can easily buy when ready\n\n\nAC\n\nGiven the shopper is on the website\nWhen they're browsing on any page\nThen the shopping cart icon is visible in the upper right\n\n\nGiven the shopper is browsing on any page\nWhen they click on the shopping cart icon\nThen they are routed to the shopping cart page",
      "itemType": {
        "id": "T1621623504973QKAJBANLK0QLBIM",
        "name": "Feature",
        "description": "Use this item to create your feature.",
