      "description": "As a Customer\nI want to add &remove it from my cart\nSo that I purchase the correct items in the wanted quantity\n\nAC\n\nGiven the shopper is on the product page\nWhen they click in the add to cart button\nThen the item should appear in the shopping cart\n\nGiven the shopper is on the shopping cart page\nWhen they click in the remove items button from the cart\nThen the item should no longer be visible in the shopping cart",
